flowchart TD
    REQ([Request: surface · scope · provider · attachments]) --> ROUTER[AIProviderRouter<br/>mode: answer·plan·execute·explain]
    ROUTER --> GROUND[Grounding<br/>ScopedAppPromptBuilder / General front-end]
    GROUND --> CLASS{Classify<br/>requiresPlanning? · native tools?}

    CLASS -->|multi-step| PLAN[Plan DAG · ChatPlanRunner<br/>order pre-resolved route ids]
    CLASS -->|native tools| LOOP[Reactive tool loop<br/>sendWithTools]
    CLASS -->|no function-calling<br/>Apple / Claude Code| TL[Tool-less prose loop<br/>runToolLessScopedTurn]

    PLAN --> TOOLS
    LOOP --> TOOLS
    TL --> TOOLS

    subgraph TOOLS[Tool registry · AgentToolRegistry]
      T1[run_capability · run_menu_command<br/>run_adapter_action · run_mcp_tool<br/>run_command · send_keys · spawn_worker<br/>read/verify tools]
    end

    TOOLS --> BUDGET[Budget + durable receipts<br/>TaskRunStore · reserveToolCall]
    BUDGET --> AUTH{Authority + access<br/>allowedToolNames · refusesChanges<br/>AppAccessLevel · risk level}
    AUTH -->|critical| DENY[Hard-denied before approval]
    AUTH -->|needs approval| APPROVE[ApprovalCenter]
    AUTH -->|allowed| RUN[Execute route]
    APPROVE -->|approved| RUN
    RUN --> VERIFY{Verify<br/>AgentAnswerVerifier · CommandOutcomeVerifier}
    VERIFY -->|contradicted / unproven| LOOP
    VERIFY -->|ok| ANS([Answer + receipts])
    ANS --> LEDGER[(AITokenLedger · AnthropicPromptCache)]
